  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voltalia rights offering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity investment of EUR 25m to acquire a minority stake of 2.8% in the  renewable energy developer Voltalia SA. The investment is part of a larger  capital increase of EUR 376m to finance the investment programme of the company  for the period 2020-2023. A significant portion of that growth is expected to  come from the Bank&apos;s countries of operations, in particular the southern and  eastern Mediterranean and South Eastern Europe regions.  Support the development of renewable energy in the Bank&apos;s regions. The company  has given certain undertakings targeting the investment of at least EUR 50m of  equity in the Bank&apos;s countries of operations.</narrative>
  </description>
